<p><strong>Summoned via PM:</strong></p>
<p>Hi there Costansin . Let’s take a look at your concept.</p>
<p>So my main issue is that there are details in the concept which are very vague. Without you providing these details, it’s hard to understand the overall concept and the direction you’re intending it to go in. For example:</p>
<blockquote>
<p>The brand less laptop has a shrouded origin</p>
</blockquote>
<p>Not a good start here. You need to at least have some idea how it came into being, why it’s doing the things it’s doing.</p>
<blockquote>
<p>The requirements include appearing in front of the in-built camera of the laptop and watching at least 1 video on a website that the laptop displays at all times.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>Firstly, why these requirements? They seem entirely random. Also, what video is this, and what website? Third, how are these requirements connected to each other that result in the anomaly occurring?</p>
<blockquote>
<p>The victims cannot escape and the Foundation is unable to rescue them.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>Okay, but how does the Foundation attempt to?</p>
<p>My last piece of feedback is the same as <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ocuin" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6104981); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6104981&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609258257" alt="OCuin" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6104981)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ocuin" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6104981); return false;">OCuin</a></span>'s: your concept is missing a central narrative. What you’ve indicated in that section is mere description of how the anomaly functions, not the story surrounding how it was first discovered, what happens to its users, or what the Foundation does to investigate it.</p>
<p>If you decide to revise the concept / respond below, do drop me another PM and I’ll take another look. Best of luck!</p>

